          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "وابسته (vâbaste) — \"dependent; attached\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "او هنوز از نظر مالی به پدرش وابسته است. u hanuz az nazar-e mâli be pedarash vâbaste ast. He still depends on his father for money."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Vâbaste be — dependent on. Also emotionally attached to someone."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "وابسته (vâbaste) is native Persian, built from the prefix vâ- + baste \"bound\", the participle of bastan \"to bind\" (EtymDB traces it to PIE bʰendʰ-). To depend is to be tied to something."
            }
          ]
        },
