            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "در این شرایط نمیتوانیم سفر کنیم. dar in sharâyet nemitavânim safar konim. In these circumstances we cannot travel."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "An Arabic broken plural of shart \"condition\". It also means terms: sharâyet-e qarârdâd."
            }
          ]
        },
